OL,3,AHealey tells departments to make 1%
OL,4,Acuts to fund defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has told every
OL,7,Fgovernment department to find 1% cuts
OL,8,Fin their capital budgets to fill a
OL,9,F#4.7bn hole in the funding of the
OL,10,FDefence Investment Plan.
OL,12,FThe reductions come on top of the 1%
OL,13,Fcuts departments were asked to make
OL,14,Fearlier this year in order to pay for
OL,15,Fthe initial #10.3bn of the plan's
OL,16,Foverall #15bn price tag.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
