OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey tells departments to make 1%
OL,4,Acuts to fund defence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan boosted defence spending;
OL,7,Fhowever the chancellor continues to
OL,8,Fcome under pressure to explain how he
OL,9,Fwill meet a further target of spending
OL,10,F3% of national income on defence by
OL,11,F2030.
OL,13,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,14,Faccused the chancellor of only offering
OL,15,F"a plan to have a plan" adding: "I bet
OL,16,F[Vladimir] Putin's really scared now."
